  "label": "Islamabad Red Light District",
  "description": "A misleading and false label. Islamabad, the capital of Pakistan, does not have a recognized or officially designated 'red light district' in the same sense as Amsterdam. The meme falsely equates the two locations, implying that the women in the image are part of a similar commercial sex industry in Islamabad, which is inaccurate and potentially offensive. This is a fabricated concept used to perpetuate stereotypes.",
